# Normalise to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites text files
# to CRLF, which changes their bytes and therefore the SHA256 of any archive
# built from them. Builds are meant to be reproducible from a given commit on
# any machine, so line endings cannot be allowed to vary by platform.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary content.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.tga binary
